                          "name": "Answer",
                          "fill": "#A9A5A0",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Yes, but Luma structures are engineered to comply with simplified secondary-dwelling permits in many European regions. We supply comprehensive drawings to speed up your permit applications.",
