                          "fill": "#A9A5A0",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "We use steel ground screws in place of poured concrete. They can be threaded directly into soil or rocky ground, are reversible, and have exceptionally low carbon emissions.",
